'''Homunculi''' attempt to chase Isaac but have a limited range of movement due to spawning attached to a wall or an {{dlc|a+}} [[Obstacles|Obstacle]]. Given enough time it will detach, spawning a small pool of [[Creep#Red Creep|Red Creep]] and shooting 6 projectiles in all directions and chasing quickly after Isaac. It also leaves a small pool of Red Creep upon death.

Destroying the obstacle that a Homunculus is attached to will prematurely release it.

==== Notes ====
* The Homunculi encountered in the {{E|Mr. Fred}} boss fight can only detach under Mr. Fred's command, not at free will. If there are any remaining Homunculi after Mr. Fred is killed they will remain permanently attached.
