'''Begottens''' behave like Homunculi but do not spawn any Red Creep. When it detaches from the wall or {{dlc|a+}} [[Obstacles|Obstacle]], it fires 6 blood shots in all directions, turns the room dark and becomes invisible. Attacking it causes it to temporarily become visible.

=== Notes ===
* They can spawn in unique {{R|Devil Room}} layouts if Isaac is holding the {{t|Number Magnet}}.
